ons.␀␀␀оѓ¶␀No photos yet␀␀␀Photos you download from the mesh show up here.␀From the mesh␀␀␀1 photo␀%d photos␀␀␀Newest first␀␀␀␀Show more (%d)␀␀Tap a photo to view it. Hold it to send it to a chat or delete it.␀␀Couldn't delete the photo␀␀␀Signal & traffic␀␀␀␀Signal (stale)␀␀nothing heard yet␀␀␀%lus ago␀␀␀␀%lum ago␀␀␀␀%luh ago␀␀␀␀SNR   %.1f dB␀␀␀RSSI  %d dBm␀␀␀␀Bars  %d / 4␀␀␀␀Heard %s␀␀␀␀Auto-discover␀␀␀Poll every␀␀пЂЎ  Probe now␀␀Traffic (since boot)
